      "role": "user",
      "content": "No specific protocols yet, the tech team is still finalizing the logic gates for the new engine. \n\nBut I was looking at the preliminary specs for the deterministic engine—it seems like it'll only trigger alerts when sensor data hits specific, hard-coded limits. It won't be able to flag the kinds of subtle, trending anomalies you currently catch through pattern recognition. Do you see any major issues with that shift in how we handle the telemetry?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
