      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Yes, I can see the potential issue. While the deterministic engine may be more readable and auditable, it may compromise our ability to detect subtle anomalies and trends in the data. This could lead to increased risk of false negatives, where potential issues are missed without triggering an alert. I'll discuss this with the tech team to explore possible alternatives or workarounds.",
